{"ancestors": "0,9021399,9021408", "bizKey": "9021409", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-11-17 19:05:28", "detail": "<p>题材基本面介绍：</p><p>ABF是载板主要增长点，全球领先公司产品均采用ABF载板</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/11/17/37e8b015-c0e6-4ef8-8c0b-e0275901e726-1700219356867.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 391.91px;height: 189.63px;\"/></p><p>根据华经产业研究院数据，全球ABF载板2019年平均月需求为1.85亿颗，2023年将达到3.45亿颗，19-23年CAGR=16.9%。而2019-2023年全球ABF载板平均月产能CAGR为18.6%，到2023年预计月产能达到3.31亿颗，供需缺口有所减小，但仍无法满足市场3.45亿颗的需求。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/11/17/ec5f125b-7aaf-462f-817d-e40e0822b1c7-1700219422554.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 382.99px;height: 238.84px;\"/></p><p>内资IC载板厂商扩产，资金投入充足</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/11/17/b94a9167-ccb6-455b-9567-808730f4b408-1700219521071.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 394.91px;height: 211.44px;\"/></p><p><br></p>", "firstLetter": "ZB", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 3, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "ABF载板", "parentId": 9021408, "pctChg": -0.2, "reason": "先进封装提升对ABF载板产能消耗", "remark": "", "sort": 2, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9021409, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2023-11-17 19:12:06"}
